  "description": "BEA input-output accounts: make/use (before/after redefinitions), supply-use, direct and total requirements workbooks (sector/summary 1997-2023, detail 2007/2012/2017 benchmarks) plus all GDP-by-industry API tables (annual and quarterly)",
  "source": {
    "publisher": "U.S. Bureau of Economic Analysis",
    "license_status": "public_domain_us_government",
